OL,3,GNEWSABeau Sejour Centre not
OL,4,A'financially sustainable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre is in a "persistent
OL,7,Foperating deficit" and a "solution has
OL,8,Fnot been defined", a sustainability
OL,9,Freport has said.
OL,11,FThe report said Beau Sejour had "poor
OL,12,Fenergy efficiency, accessibility gaps
OL,13,Fand significant lifecycle and
OL,14,Fmechanical and electrical replacement
OL,15,Fpressures".
OL,17,FFurther highlighted was a "patch and
OL,18,Fmend" strategy which could become a
OL,19,F"programme of managed decline" and
OL,20,Fthere was evidence for investment.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
