OL,3,GNEWSABeau Sejour Centre not
OL,4,A'financially sustainable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Montague, President of the
OL,7,FCommittee for Education, Sport &
OL,8,FCulture, admitted the centre was "not
OL,9,Fsustainable" financially and said it
OL,10,Fwas "perfectly possible that private
OL,11,Forganisations" could become become
OL,12,Finvestors, but would not comment
OL,13,Ffurther on such funding.
